<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85732" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορ-ευτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>going on foot, walking,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π. ζῷα,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτηνά, ἑρπυστικά, νευστικά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				487b16
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κίνησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>de An.</u>
					432b14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>for a march,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π. διαστήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					12.19.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀγωγή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					12.20.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>for conveyance,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ π. Ἀλεξανδρεῖνος στόλος,</span> of
			the cornfleet, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.918
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ στόλος . . ὁ ἐκ πλοίων πορευτικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
					2.447
				</span></i>
			 (Alexandria, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
